{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2020-04-08 09:30:00', 'title': 'HHS ANNOUNCES VENTILATOR CONTRACT WITH GM UNDER DEFENSE PRODUCTION ACT', 'text': 'HHS ANNOUNCES VENTILATOR CONTRACT WITH GM UNDER DEFENSE PRODUCTION ACT.HHS - GM’S CONTRACT, AT CONTRACT PRICE OF $489.4 MILLION, IS FOR 30,000 VENTILATORS TO BE DELIVERED BY THE END OF AUGUST.HHS - PRODUCTION SCHEDULE FOR GM’S CONTRACT ALLOWS FOR THE DELIVERY OF 6,132 VENTILATORS BY JUNE 1, 2020.'}